title: "Carry Geometry"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Massensini
    given-names: Thiago
repository-code: "https://github.com/thiagomassensini/carry-geometry"
url: "https://github.com/thiagomassensini/carry-geometry"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.1
date-released: 2026-08-16
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the positional foundation and finite camera
  transport of carry geometry, including unique quotient-remainder
  decomposition, forced finite-alphabet normalization, arithmetic carry
  propagation, uniform carry probability, quadratic amplitude rigidity,
  base independence, exact matched-window equivalences, and one-sided
  value-preserving embeddings with compression-weighted signal transport.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formalized mathematics
  - positional representation
  - carry geometry
  - finite alphabet
  - Euclidean normalization
  - quadratic amplitude
  - base independence
  - finite camera transport
  - coordinate embedding
  - partial isometry
  - reproducible proof audit
